              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "тоска (toská) — \"longing; melancholy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Она чувствует тоску по родине. Oná chúvstvuyet toskú po ródine. She feels homesick."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Тоска по + dative — longing for."
            }
          ]
